.TH MKINITRAMFS.CONF 5 "2026-07-15" "mkinitramfs" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
mkinitramfs.conf \- configuration file for mkinitramfs
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmkinitramfs.conf\fP is sourced as a shell script by \fBmkinitramfs\fP(8)
at the start of image generation.  It defines the default compression,
hooks, and optional extra files, binaries, and kernel modules to include.
.PP
The file is read from \fI/etc/mkinitramfs.conf\fP by default; a different
path may be specified with \fBmkinitramfs \-c\fP.
.SH VARIABLES
.TP
\fBINIT_FS_COMP\fP
Compression format for the output image.  Supported values:
\fBgzip\fP (default), \fBxz\fP, \fBzstd\fP, \fBlz4\fP, \fBnone\fP.
Can be overridden at runtime with \fBmkinitramfs \-C\fP.
.TP
\fBHOOKS\fP
Space-separated list of hooks to run, in order.  Each name resolves to a
\&\fI.hook\fP file under \fBHOOKDIRS\fP (default:
\&\fI/usr/share/mkinitramfs/hooks\fP).
.br
Example: \fBHOOKS="base modules udev"\fP
.br
Can be modified at runtime with \fB\-A\fP (prepend), \fB\-a\fP (append),
and \fB\-s\fP (skip).
.TP
\fBBINARIES\fP
Space-separated list of extra binaries to include.  Each is resolved via
\fBPATH\fP and its shared library dependencies are pulled in automatically.
.TP
\fBMODULES\fP
Space-separated list of extra kernel modules to include.  Dependencies
and firmware are resolved recursively via \fBmodinfo\fP(8).
.TP
\fBFILES\fP
Space-separated list of extra files to include.  Paths must be absolute.
.TP
\fBINITRAMFS\fP
Output path for the generated image.  If unset, defaults to
\&\fIinitrd\-\fP\fIversion\fP\fI.img\fP in the current directory.
Can be overridden at runtime with \fBmkinitramfs \-o\fP.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
# Use gzip compression
INIT_FS_COMP="gzip"

# No extra binaries, modules, or files by default
BINARIES=""
MODULES=""
FILES=""

# Hooks to run: base layout, kernel modules, udev
HOOKS="base modules udev"
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmkinitramfs\fP(8),
\fBlsmkinitramfs\fP(1)
